INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Theoretical Framework','Quantum Social Science · Foucault (dispositif/infrapower) · Arendt (right to have rights) · Bauman (liquid modernity) · Morin (complex thought/dialogic) · Barad (agential realism) · Lindblad (non-separability)','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Empirical Sources','Aqueduct 4.0 (WRI) · USGS MCS 2025 (Jan 2025) · TeleGeography 2025 · EMODnet Q2-2025 · SubmarineCableMap · ITU GCI 2024 · EU ESC CTPI · IEA WEO 2025 Annex A (Nov 2025) · OECD TiVA 2025 · EU CRMA Reg. 2024/1252  |  Aqueduct 4.0 (WRI, Hofste et al. 2024) — 35-country batch SSP1/SSP3 2030/2050/2080  |  Krippendorff (2004) Content Analysis — ICR methodology  |  KEY/EFF_SOVEREIGNTY: 35-country Jurisdictional Tier expansion (v6.1)','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Audit Purpose','Documents all non-trivial methodological decisions for DPhil viva, peer review, and data integrity verification. Each entry records the theoretical justification, alternative rejected, and coding implication.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('DECISION 1 — fsQCA TRUTH TABLE DESIGN (Task 7)  |  THREE-TABLE ARCHITECTURE  |  Sheet: 📐 fsQCA Truth Tables','','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Decision','Three distinct fsQCA truth tables, not one combined table.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Rationale','Morin''s complex thought: physical constraints, political discourse, and quantum entanglement operate as distinct but interrelated analytical layers. Collapsing them violates the configurational logic of QESIPE. Methodological: k=10+ produces 1,024+ configurations far exceeding n=35, violating k < n/3 rule of thumb.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Table 1 — Physical (n=35)','Outcome: HIGH_SOVEREIGN_VULNERABILITY (calibrated on QESIPE+ score).
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Table 2 — Discourse (n=15, EU+G7)','Outcome: SOVEREIGN_POLICY_COHERENCE — whether political speech constitutes material infrastructure investment (Foucault: performativity of sovereignty discourse).
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Table 3 — Quantum Entanglement (n=35)','Outcome: SOVEREIGN_DECOHERENCE_2050 — trajectory of sovereign infrastructure coherence loss by 2050.
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('RL Integration (Chapter 5)','fsQCA causal configurations become Q-learning transition function:
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Sources','Ragin (2008) Redesigning Social Inquiry · Fiss (2011) Set-theoretic approach · EU Parl P10_TA(2026)0022 · Draghi (2024) Future of European Competitiveness · Knafo (2025) A-10-2025-0107 · ENISA Foresight 2030 (Mar 2024) · FISA §702 Congressional Record (2023)','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('DECISION 2 — CSE DUAL-LAYER ARCHITECTURE  |  Cols: E (CSE_EMO) · F (CSE_SCM) · G (CSE_COMPOSITE)  |  Sheet: 🧮 QESIS+','','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Decision','Dual-layer CSE: preserve EMODnet CSE_EMO (col E) + add SubmarineMap CSE_SCM (col F) + compute weighted CSE_COMPOSITE (col G). Do NOT overwrite or collapse.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Rationale (Morin)','Dialogic principle: EMODnet measures cable sovereignty (governmentality — who controls). SubmarineMap measures cable count (physical density — how many). These are non-commuting observables: mixing them introduces basis mismatch. Like measuring spin-x with spin-z operator — the result is not wrong, it is incommensurable.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('The Italy Paradox','ITA: CSE_EMO=0 yet ITA has 27 cables AND Mazara del Vallo = #1 betweenness globally (0.067). The contradiction IS the finding: Italy has cables but not cable sovereignty. Preserving both columns makes this analytically tractable. Collapsing erases the most theoretically significant case in the dataset.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Rejected: SCM-only','Destroys EMODnet EU-tier data integrity. Makes ITA/DEU/POL CSE incomparable with validated EU values. Produces false precision for non-EU countries by treating cable count as cable sovereignty.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Rejected: EMO-only','Renders QESIPE non-computable for 25/35 countries. Limits thesis to EU scope. Loses the global comparative framework.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('CSE_EMO (col E)','Source: EMODnet Q2-2025 via CTPI Evidence Pack. Countries: SAU, BEL, ESP, POL, NLD, SWE, DNK, GBR, ITA, DEU. Measures: regulatory cable sovereignty. Foucauldian dimension: GOVERNMENTALITY. Status: PRESERVED UNCHANGED from v5.0.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('CSE_SCM (col F)','Source: SubmarineCableMap 2025 via cable_landings_by_country.csv. Formula: Unique Cables ÷ 72 (USA max) × 100. Countries: 144. Measures: physical cable density. Foucauldian dimension: MATERIAL INFRASTRUCTURE. Note: landlocked countries (DEU, AUT, CHE) score near-zero correctly — they have no submarine landings.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('CSE_COMPOSITE (col G)','Formula: IF CSE_EMO present → 0.6×CSE_EMO + 0.4×CSE_SCM; ELSE → CSE_SCM.
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Suggested Thesis Language','"CSE_COMPOSITE employs a dual-source synthesis acknowledging that cable governance (EU: EMODnet) and cable density (global: SubmarineCableMap) are non-commuting observables in the quantum measurement sense. The 0.6/0.4 weighted composite represents a first-order approximation of their joint state, preserving the incommensurability as a documented methodological limitation rather than collapsing it into false precision."','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Sources','EMODnet Bathymetry Q2-2025 · SubmarineCableMap 2025 (TeleGeography) · Barad (2007) Meeting the Universe Halfway · Morin (2008) On Complexity · Foucault (1978) History of Sexuality Vol.1','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('DECISION 3 — GCI REWEIGHT: OPTION B INVERSE MODERATOR  |  Col: W (QESIPE+)  |  Sheet: 🧮 QESIS+','','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Decision','GCI as RESILIENCE MULTIPLIER (inverse moderator), not additive vulnerability axis. OPTION B selected.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Option A — Rejected','Additive: QESIPE+ = WSE×0.27 + CSE×0.27 + ODI×0.15 + CRD×0.08 + REE×0.15 + GCI×0.08
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Option B — Selected
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Theoretical Basis — Bauman','Liquid Modernity (2000): institutional capacity is the ability to navigate liquid structures, not a fixed property of solid infrastructure. GCI = capacity to navigate the liquid digital environment → it REDUCES the weight of physical vulnerability, not adds to it. Option A would commit the error of treating navigational capacity as a burden.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Theoretical Basis — Foucault/EP','EU Parliament P10_TA(2026)0022: "market need for sovereign solutions that offer enhanced levels of control over data." High GCI = state has institutionalised awareness of and response to digital risk = GOVERNMENTALITY operating. It does not eliminate the dispositif of dependency, but it activates counter-conducts. GCI is the counter-conduct variable.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Theoretical Basis — BIG Framework','BIG (Biopolitical Infrastructure Governance) three-layer model requires governance (G layer) to function as response-to and moderator-of physical constraints (I layer). Option B correctly encodes this: physical exposure drives base score; governance moderates it. The architectural separation mirrors the BIG theoretical architecture.','','','');
INSERT INTO "v8_theoretical_memo" VALUES('Data Integrity','QESIS Theory (col N), QESIS+ Base (col O), QESIS+ Stress (col P): UNCHANGED.
