INSERT INTO "v8_viva_prep" VALUES('Q: Your earlier drafts reported an Entanglement Ratio of 0.515. What was it?');
INSERT INTO "v8_viva_prep" VALUES('A (one sentence): “The 0.515 was the off-diagonal Frobenius share of a three-axis correlation matrix — a legitimate coupling heuristic but not the von Neumann statistic my methodology specifies — so v7 recomputed the coupling per the stated formalism over the canonical six axes, yielding the two-tier result (0.110 global, 0.163 core) that now anchors the thesis.');
INSERT INTO "v8_viva_prep" VALUES('Q: Why does the coupling DROP when you add the Gulf states?');
INSERT INTO "v8_viva_prep" VALUES('A: “Because entanglement is geopolitical, not universal: energy-rich states use cheap, reliable, carbon-heavy power as a sovereign shock absorber that decouples their energy axis, so the aggregate dilutes — the coupling is a property of the import-dependent core, which is precisely the thesis.”');
INSERT INTO "v8_viva_prep" VALUES('Q: Isn''t your outcome derived from your conditions?');
INSERT INTO "v8_viva_prep" VALUES('A: “No — r = +0.487 between the published outcome and the condition-derived composite, and the anti-circularity run shows a purely composite-derived outcome WEAKENS the solution (0.708 vs 0.807); circularity would inflate it.”');
INSERT INTO "v8_viva_prep" VALUES('Q: Where do the ESE numbers come from?');
INSERT INTO "v8_viva_prep" VALUES('A: “Every one of the 35 scores is reproducible from the published component table — Ember carbon intensity, IEA/Eurostat industrial price, World Bank SAIDI — under declared weights (40/30/30) and bounds; the audit sheet is in the master workbook.”');
