Use: USA EXEC_DISC=0.95. Hyperscaler hegemony discourse: USA explicitly leverages EU digital dependency as strategic intelligence asset. Foucault: panopticon at infrastructure scale.','','','');
— CEPA, Digital Sovereignty: Can Europe Afford It?, Oct 2025
Use: Contextualises INVEST condition — no EU country can credibly commit to full sovereign stack. Draghi''s "too late" is confirmed by cost arithmetic.','','','');

2. CSE_EMO (col E) values from EMODnet are preserved verbatim from v5.0. Column label updated to clarify source — values unchanged.

3. QESIS Theory (N), QESIS+ Base (O), QESIS+ Stress (P) formula scores: UNCHANGED.

4. WSE_2050 data tagged to Aqueduct 4.0. USGS REE data tagged to MCS 2024 pp.144–145. Corridor data tagged to TeleGeography 2025.

