8. CSE_COMPOSITE for non-EU countries = SCM-only. This documented limitation must be disclosed in thesis methodology section.','','','');
fsQCA Conditions: PARL_RES (Parliamentary/legislative resolutions formally adopted on digital sovereignty, cable security, or REE independence) and LEGAL_ACT (binding legal instruments — EU AI Act, CHIPS Act, FISA §702).
CSovE Bridge: CSovE_CLAIM maps precisely here. NDC pledges are the ritualistic performance of climate ambition — the state enacting sovereignty over a process it cannot audit. EU Parliament P10_TA(2026)0022 is the canonical Symbolic event: a resolution asserting technological sovereignty over infrastructure the EU does not manufacture.
Lacanian mechanism: The Symbolic order functions through the repetition of signifiers (regulatory text, pledge language, resolution numbers) to constitute the sovereign subject. High PARL_RES + high CSovE_CLAIM = maximum Symbolic assertion with minimum Real substrate.','','','');
fsQCA Conditions: CHOKE_AWR (Chokepoint Awareness — explicit state recognition of physical chokepoint dependency in official documents, intelligence assessments, or military posture).
CSovE Bridge: CSovE_VERIFY maps here — the unyielding planetary boundary and satellite-verified actual emissions (ClimateTRACE). The Real cannot be symbolised away.
Non-commutativity proof: [Ô_sym, Ô_rup] ≠ 0. A state cannot simultaneously (a) maximize its symbolic claim about carbon sovereignty AND (b) minimize its real substrate emission exposure. The failure to commute is the QCT formalisation of the Epistemic Sovereignty Gap.
Key SUBSTRATE_RUPTURE events: Kariba scandal (2023); Shell fraudulent projects (Dec 2025); US Paris Agreement withdrawal (Jan 2026); Frankfurt Climate Ruling (Aug 2025); Mazara del Vallo cable cut (Italian Real/Symbolic paradox).','','','');
fsQCA Conditions: EXEC_DISC (Executive Discourse — PM/President/Ministry formal statements repeatedly invoking digital sovereignty without corresponding substrate investment) and INVEST (sovereign infrastructure investment commitments — the imaginary made material).
Mechanism: EXEC_DISC without CHOKE_AWR = pure Imaginary projection. The sovereign subject constitutes itself through its own reflection (the "Cloud Neutral" claim, the "Net Zero by 2050" pledge) without encountering the Real. High EXEC_DISC + low CHOKE_AWR + high CSovE_CLAIM is the canonical IMAGINARY_PROJECTION configuration.
DEU case: EXEC_DISC=0.95 (repeated Habeck/Von der Leyen sovereignty statements), INVEST=0.95 (IPCEI Me/4, Giga factories), but CSovE ranking = 30/35 ACTIVE — the Imaginary is being materially grounded. Contrast with BHR: EXEC_DISC absent, INVEST=0, CSovE_GAP=85 INFR — the gap between claim and substrate is maximal.','','','');
In quantum terms: these 14 countries represent a mixed state where the density matrix ρ(t) lacks sufficient independent verification to collapse into a defined eigenvalue. Refusing to score them is the Lacanian imperative to "assume the lack" — data absence is a verified symptom of infrastructural opacity, not a gap to be filled synthetically.
Chapter 4 framing: document explicitly that BIG protocol was applied; include a table of the 14 countries with their known CSovE analogues from adjacent CAT/ClimateTRACE data; note that most are advanced-economy ACTIVE-tier states (EU core + Canada + USA + Israel) where CSovE_GAP < 50 would be expected, suggesting QESIS_EXTENDED would move them marginally rather than structurally.','','','');

WEF metric (2,752 discriminatory trade policies): Background "liquefaction" of global trade in Bauman''s sense. Micro-level friction from minilateralist re-narrativization of supply chains. Represents the quantum decoherence rate of the global economy — diffuse, multipolar fragmentation. Maps to the Imaginary register: each policy is a symbolic assertion of sovereignty without necessarily constituting a Real substrate rupture.

WTO metric (169 measures / $887.7Bn): Macro-level Substrate Rupture in Arendt''s sense. Hard, localized blockages representing Arendt''s "work" — deliberate, material state interventions weaponizing physical boundaries of the 4IR. Maps to the Real register: each measure is a physical chokepoint operationalized. The $887.7Bn figure represents the monetary mass of the Real that the Symbolic cannot absorb.

Drafting note: "The WEF figure (2,752 policies) captures the fluid, decentralized dissolution of the multilateral order — the Baumanesque liquefaction of trade norms into minilateral fragments. The WTO figure (169 measures, $887.7Bn) captures the concentrated, material weaponization of capital — Arendt''s ''work'' deployed as geopolitical instrument. Together they operationalise the dual movement of the Cathedrical Code: Imaginary fragmentation driving Real rupture."','','','');
